 "speech": "Team, today was a little bit of everything.\n\nTale of the tape: 15 games, 39 goals scored, 33 let in. 5 wins, 4 draws, 6 losses.\n\nThat 6-2 over WhoDisBic was a clinic. Let's teach it to ourselves again. The 0-4 loss to Project 2030 showed us exactly what to fix. The difference between our wins and our losses today was focus, plain and simple.\n\nMiddling days are where good teams quietly become great ones. This is that day.\n\nPhogsToffees, 13 goals, 13 assists, 23 key passes across 15 games and a 7.9 average. That's the kind of day that makes a coach misty. BellyTb1: 12 goals, 9 assists, 10 key passes, 7.8 average. You were the steady heartbeat of this team today. And tuxedo_slide, 8 goals, 2 assists, 11 key passes and a 7.1 average over 10 games. Don't you dare let anybody tell you that didn't matter.\n\nLoved the PhogsToffees-BellyTb1 connection: 25 goals.\n\nRain makes the corn grow. Today was a little rain.\n\nPriority number one: defensive work rate. Get stuck in. A won tackle is worth about 0.2 rating, and even 1 in 8 pays for the attempts.\n\nWhere does that leave us? We're in Division 3, playing promotion matches for Division 2. 1 down, 3 to go, and we need 3 more wins. Nobody said climbing was easy, but the view's worth it.\n\nI'd rather coach a team that's figuring it out than one that thinks it already has. Stay hungry, stay humble, stay together.\n\nLove the fight. Let's add the finish.",
